$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("[[Duration: no time limit | Difficulty: None]] The fleet is at anchor in a quiet system. No enemies, no orders, no clock. Take a Viper out and fly around the battlestar, the frigate, the tanker and the liners. Leave whenever you like.", -1)
$end_multi_text

